    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about the job tho. it's the feeling that i'm stuck in this loop forever. like no matter what i do, nothing actually changes. i'm just waiting for time to pass until i die, and even then it won't matter. i'm just so tired of the repetition.",
